# Route-sweep output: a full-page screenshot per route x width x theme cell
# plus the JSON defect list. Regenerated by `playwright test e2e/sweep.spec.ts`
# and far too large (and too machine-specific) to commit.
/e2e/__screens__/

# Written by `next dev` on every start, not authored.
AGENTS.md

# Win-rate sweep shard partials. These are RESUMPTION STATE, not results: each
# is rewritten every 10 cards so a killed run continues instead of restarting,
# so a committed snapshot would be a fraction of a sweep that reads like a
# finished one. The merged result is committed on completion.
docs/card-winrate.shard*.json

# Agent scratch: probe scripts and screenshots from a verification run.
.eval-verify/
